WEBVTT

00:01.470 --> 00:06.620
We originally came here 
to investigate this lake!

00:06.620 --> 00:07.710
Investigate?

00:08.890 --> 00:10.990
That's not a lake.

00:11.490 --> 00:13.360
It's not a lake?

00:13.360 --> 00:15.800
Yeah, it's a spirit.

00:31.060 --> 00:31.990
That's...

00:36.190 --> 00:38.360
The hero of the spirits...

00:39.150 --> 00:42.020
Spirit Sovereign Rikugen Kyoko!

00:43.210 --> 00:44.560
Humans...

00:46.670 --> 00:47.820
You're in the way.

01:00.320 --> 01:04.870
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

02:30.330 --> 02:32.880
Universal Mirroring: Ocean.

02:32.880 --> 02:33.980
Wha— Watch out!

02:57.990 --> 02:58.990
Not yet!

03:01.230 --> 03:02.160
Now!

03:02.160 --> 03:03.410
Burn it all to ashes!

03:08.590 --> 03:11.040
Universal Mirroring: Fire.

03:16.210 --> 03:17.140
What?!

03:25.180 --> 03:26.600
Code Holder!

03:44.210 --> 03:47.370
Is that the Code Holder?

03:47.760 --> 03:48.710
Huh?

03:58.680 --> 04:00.060
Caution.

04:00.660 --> 04:05.590
Confirmed contact between hero 
of the spirits and the Code Holder.

04:11.640 --> 04:14.900
That female voice just now. 
Was that you, Reiren?

04:15.260 --> 04:18.550
It wasn't me. Was it you, Rinne?

04:18.550 --> 04:21.390
It wasn't me. It was you, Jeannie, right?

04:21.390 --> 04:22.530
H-Hey!

04:22.530 --> 04:23.820
Answer, human!

04:24.810 --> 04:26.950
Why do you have that?

04:27.970 --> 04:30.460
The spirits can speak?

04:31.530 --> 04:34.240
That sword was in the 
possession of that human.

04:34.900 --> 04:41.060
That human, what he did to me... made me...

04:42.840 --> 04:44.170
Is that...

04:44.590 --> 04:46.270
Are you talking about Sid?

04:46.270 --> 04:47.240
Sid...

04:48.530 --> 04:50.280
That's right. Sid.

04:51.130 --> 04:53.130
The existence I hate the most.

04:53.470 --> 04:56.000
The enemy of all spirits...

04:57.270 --> 05:01.590
But a human... 
who brought wisdom to Kyoko.

05:03.970 --> 05:08.110
Kyoko learned... the human language...

05:09.330 --> 05:12.370
in order to understand Sid's words.

05:15.060 --> 05:17.210
The retaliation of fate is about to begin.

05:19.170 --> 05:21.940
World reincarnation is only the beginning...

05:23.090 --> 05:26.650
The world is... beginning to transform.

05:28.090 --> 05:30.120
Only... the beginning?

05:31.390 --> 05:35.560
Don't tell me, there's more to come 
after the world reincarnation?

05:40.970 --> 05:46.660
Hero of the spirits experiencing 
influence from the taboo word "Sid."

05:47.030 --> 05:48.970
What is <i>that</i>?

05:51.280 --> 05:52.210
That thing?!

05:52.530 --> 05:53.990
That's the one that was with Alfreya!

05:54.690 --> 05:56.290
Last Riser!

05:56.670 --> 05:58.630
Executing Zero Code.

05:59.160 --> 06:01.820
Removing Rikugen Kyoko's code from the world—

06:03.470 --> 06:07.840
That's right. Kyoko was annoyed at you.

06:11.880 --> 06:14.510
Unexpected damage.

06:14.510 --> 06:17.520
Prioritizing protection of sealed body.

06:30.050 --> 06:31.360
We're done.

06:31.360 --> 06:32.290
What?

06:33.160 --> 06:34.990
Kyoko is tired.

06:35.530 --> 06:38.000
So we're done for now.

06:40.040 --> 06:42.030
What are you scheming?

06:42.030 --> 06:45.420
Are you trying to buy time, spirit?

06:47.130 --> 06:52.090
There's a certain charm to your stupidity, 
but it's exhausting to explain.

06:52.090 --> 06:53.510
What did you say?

06:53.890 --> 06:56.330
Kyoko proposes a ceasefire.

06:56.330 --> 06:59.020
You're the one who 
attacked us in the first place!

06:59.360 --> 07:00.740
It was unavoidable.

07:01.310 --> 07:05.130
I thought I was getting ambushed 
when I was regenerating.

07:06.220 --> 07:07.710
Regenerating...

07:08.420 --> 07:11.280
You were drained that much?

07:11.800 --> 07:14.730
You, the hero of the spirits?

07:15.410 --> 07:20.720
You're a little smarter. 
So you're not as charming.

07:20.720 --> 07:21.650
What?

07:22.630 --> 07:25.620
Kyoko was fighting with Rath=IE.

07:25.620 --> 07:27.540
The hero of the mythical beasts?!

07:29.030 --> 07:30.780
That hero is strong.

07:30.780 --> 07:34.760
But what was more troublesome was <i>that</i> thing.

07:35.420 --> 07:39.520
It's the same type of monster 
that attacked Kyoko before.

07:39.520 --> 07:41.480
The Last Riser?

07:41.480 --> 07:43.140
Last Riser...

07:43.900 --> 07:47.150
That's right. Sid called it that, too.

07:48.980 --> 07:50.190
Sid...

07:51.030 --> 07:53.440
knew about the Last Risers?

07:55.090 --> 07:59.270
All the five races 
only wish the best for their race.

07:59.720 --> 08:03.160
But that thing is not part of any race.

08:04.120 --> 08:05.210
Not a demon,

08:05.750 --> 08:07.170
a celestial,

08:07.710 --> 08:09.130
a spirit,

08:09.570 --> 08:11.090
a mythical beast,

08:11.620 --> 08:13.100
nor a human.

08:13.920 --> 08:15.310
That's why it's dangerous.

08:16.390 --> 08:20.140
Last Riser is pure hatred of this world.

08:20.660 --> 08:23.220
An enemy to the world.

08:25.830 --> 08:27.640
The words are credible.

08:28.100 --> 08:32.330
That monster, known as 
the Last Riser, not only attacked us,

08:32.750 --> 08:36.160
but has assaulted Vanessa and Alfreya as well.

08:37.460 --> 08:40.110
So you're telling us to just
 do what our enemy wants?

08:40.820 --> 08:44.560
We've been fighting 
the spirits this whole time.

08:44.560 --> 08:46.150
We can't just...

08:46.570 --> 08:51.840
I have agreed to a ceasefire with 
the demons and the celestials, as well.

08:54.620 --> 08:58.520
There's no need to forget about 
the past and become close with them.

08:59.270 --> 09:02.090
However, if we could establish 
a non-aggression pact,

09:02.090 --> 09:05.500
we should be able to limit future sacrifices.

09:08.650 --> 09:12.230
For now, we'll put down our weapons.

09:12.650 --> 09:16.100
Is that so? Then Kyoko will go.

09:16.600 --> 09:17.530
Go where?

09:18.620 --> 09:24.330
To that black house. That's where 
Kyoko first met with Last Riser.

09:24.690 --> 09:25.800
The graveyard?

09:26.470 --> 09:29.230
Do you mean before the
world reincarnation occurred?

09:30.330 --> 09:31.270
Graveyard...

09:32.220 --> 09:36.270
That's right, the graveyard. 
More and more I'm starting to remember.

09:36.690 --> 09:39.860
After Sid left, that thing appeared.

09:41.720 --> 09:43.480
The Dark Empress was condescending towards it,

09:44.530 --> 09:46.270
the Lord of Heavens rejected it,

09:47.350 --> 09:49.590
and Kyoko had her doubts.

09:51.400 --> 09:54.380
The Fang King Rath=IE was 
the only one who accepted it.

09:55.890 --> 09:59.790
That beast... it coexists with the Last Riser.

09:59.790 --> 10:03.010
What?! To become even stronger?

10:03.370 --> 10:07.130
No, there is no way 
the hero of the mythical beasts

10:07.130 --> 10:10.670
would rely on someone to become stronger.

10:11.390 --> 10:13.750
What Rath=IE seeks is probably...

10:14.820 --> 10:18.990
something other than an outcome 
of the Great War of the Five Races.

10:21.310 --> 10:23.220
Sorry to keep you waiting. Let's go.

10:24.780 --> 10:27.480
Human, where is the entrance?

10:27.820 --> 10:29.550
It's probably this way.

10:29.550 --> 10:30.650
Follow me.

10:38.940 --> 10:40.010
This is...

10:40.410 --> 10:44.580
Yeah, it's the same as the demons' 
graveyard in the Urza Federation.

10:49.460 --> 10:51.840
It's a mysterious building.

10:52.290 --> 10:54.590
It doesn't belong to the celestials,

10:54.590 --> 10:57.320
and it's not something made by humans, right?

10:57.320 --> 11:00.800
So this is one of those megaliths, then.

11:02.010 --> 11:04.510
It's the same layout 
as the demons' graveyard.

11:09.880 --> 11:12.500
I found the Code Holder just ahead.

11:15.620 --> 11:16.710
This place is...

11:29.630 --> 11:32.840
<i>Those wrapped in the fate of hatred.</i>

11:36.630 --> 11:37.960
It's Sid's voice!

11:37.960 --> 11:40.120
That's what I thought.

11:41.530 --> 11:46.980
<i>I have made a mistake 
and was unable to protect Rinne.</i>

11:48.920 --> 11:51.740
<i>Please... reach that place.</i>

11:54.210 --> 11:58.890
<i>The other future 
that I was unable to go to...</i>

12:16.000 --> 12:18.960
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

12:19.050 --> 12:21.970
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

12:27.590 --> 12:29.770
What is this place?

12:30.510 --> 12:34.790
We were inside the building a second ago...

12:36.200 --> 12:40.840
I don't like it. It feels like 
we're being lured into a trap.

12:40.840 --> 12:42.150
I feel the same.

12:42.580 --> 12:44.240
Kai, explain.

12:44.700 --> 12:46.620
I'm not sure either.

12:47.140 --> 12:49.660
Back in Urza, I was taken here as well, and...

12:54.190 --> 12:55.620
Where are you going?!

12:58.530 --> 13:01.390
There is a vast source 
of magical power over there.

13:10.430 --> 13:11.930
This is...

13:13.100 --> 13:14.030
Wha—

13:15.800 --> 13:18.340
Lord... Alfreya?

13:25.500 --> 13:27.160
I feel magical power...

13:28.860 --> 13:29.850
This is...

13:31.000 --> 13:33.500
I see. Petrification magic.

13:34.150 --> 13:35.620
If we could just analyze it...

13:39.210 --> 13:41.290
What do you plan on doing, human?!

13:40.050 --> 13:41.950
Ah, let go!

13:41.950 --> 13:44.200
If you're saying this is 
the hero of the celestials,

13:44.200 --> 13:46.540
then destroying it right now 
is for the good of humanity!

13:46.540 --> 13:48.200
I'm not going to let you do that!

13:48.200 --> 13:49.510
Let go!

13:50.750 --> 13:52.890
This isn't just any petrification.

13:54.820 --> 13:57.000
It looks like it's frozen.

13:57.790 --> 14:00.310
The stone-like appearance 
is only on the surface.

14:01.860 --> 14:06.530
Zero Code... I'm beginning 
to see how it all works.

14:07.450 --> 14:10.710
What is going on? What is this place?

14:10.710 --> 14:14.080
I don't know. But when I came here before...

14:20.600 --> 14:24.100
Unauthorized intrusion 
on coordinate-free field detected.

14:24.100 --> 14:26.510
Proximity response near sealed body detected.

14:27.370 --> 14:28.920
Sealed body...

14:28.920 --> 14:31.680
Is it referring to Alfreya?

14:34.400 --> 14:39.040
Threat level of interference with new 
world determined: "Requires caution."

14:39.810 --> 14:45.150
Last Riser Aspect 1: 
"Will of Destruction" commencing exclusion.

14:45.150 --> 14:46.660
Good timing.

14:46.660 --> 14:49.360
I can avenge Lord Alfreya.

14:49.720 --> 14:51.210
What a terrible smell.

14:51.730 --> 14:54.830
The smell of death in the air, 
enough to make you nauseous.

14:57.220 --> 14:58.750
How grotesque!

15:00.900 --> 15:03.090
Sorting complete.

15:03.090 --> 15:07.880
Destroy three who responded 
to taboo word, "Sid."

15:08.690 --> 15:11.590
Exclude the four with no response.

15:15.430 --> 15:16.290
Jeanne!

15:16.290 --> 15:17.220
Kai!

15:17.850 --> 15:19.560
I swear I'll return!

15:22.770 --> 15:25.480
Kai. Jeannie and the others are...

15:25.890 --> 15:31.240
Don't worry. "Exclude" means Jeanne 
and the others were sent outside.

15:31.710 --> 15:35.240
This thing intentionally kept us here.

15:35.690 --> 15:36.860
Agreed.

15:36.860 --> 15:41.440
It probably selected those 
who possess the memory of Sid.

15:41.970 --> 15:48.210
In other words, our existence 
in this world is seen as an inconvenience.

15:49.260 --> 15:50.950
Commencing destruction!

15:55.050 --> 15:56.140
Damn it!

16:00.270 --> 16:01.770
Jeanne-sama, where are you heading?

16:02.140 --> 16:07.020
I'm going back. The door to 
the alternate space should still be there.

16:07.410 --> 16:09.550
That monster is abnormal.

16:09.940 --> 16:13.410
If you were to go back, do you 
really think you could beat it?

16:15.900 --> 16:18.870
I have a last resort.

16:19.480 --> 16:23.740
Don't do it. Don't shorten 
your life for something like this.

16:24.200 --> 16:27.380
The door to the alternate space 
has already closed as well.

16:28.380 --> 16:29.840
Then what is it I should do?

16:30.430 --> 16:32.300
First, we need a plan.

16:36.030 --> 16:37.720
I agree.

16:37.720 --> 16:41.160
I have no intention of backing out now.

16:41.160 --> 16:45.480
We'll re-enter once we've gathered 
our weapons and finished preparing.

16:45.790 --> 16:49.360
Yep. There's also something 
I'd like to try.

16:50.030 --> 16:51.540
Lend me a hand.

16:55.300 --> 16:57.410
Universal Mirroring: Ocean!

16:59.450 --> 17:00.810
Zero Code.

17:12.930 --> 17:17.000
You are involved in this. 
Why are you not fighting?

17:17.930 --> 17:19.260
I don't know...

17:20.200 --> 17:24.030
I'm scared of that thing. 
I really don't like it.

17:24.030 --> 17:25.760
I don't want to look at it.

17:27.700 --> 17:32.160
Why? I want to fight alongside Kai, too...

17:32.860 --> 17:35.420
Then at least lend me your magic.

17:35.420 --> 17:36.350
What?

17:45.390 --> 17:47.420
It helped a little.

17:51.470 --> 17:52.900
Damn it!

17:53.890 --> 17:55.920
Universal Mirroring: Ice.

17:58.630 --> 17:59.720
Shatter!

18:05.260 --> 18:06.590
Amazing.

18:08.210 --> 18:09.310
Something is not right.

18:10.950 --> 18:14.100
Executing Last Riser overwrite.

18:23.100 --> 18:24.740
Can't believe this thing...

18:24.740 --> 18:29.750
If it could regenerate, why didn't it 
do so when Kyoko damaged it before?

18:30.010 --> 18:33.470
Come to think of it, the same thing 
happened when it fought Vanessa.

18:34.130 --> 18:37.380
I see, the only time it can 
regenerate is when...

18:37.680 --> 18:39.450
When it's within this alternate space.

18:40.550 --> 18:45.900
Human, how did you escape this space 
when you were last here?

18:45.900 --> 18:48.020
At the time, I was in a panic...

18:54.500 --> 18:58.190
I just sliced the alternate space 
with the Code Holder.

18:58.190 --> 19:03.190
It's a bit frustrating for Kyoko 
to have to rely on that sword.

19:07.330 --> 19:08.260
Huh?

19:11.950 --> 19:14.010
Just as I thought, this is important to it.

19:14.510 --> 19:16.520
We'll use this to lure it outside.

19:16.920 --> 19:18.410
Don't damage it, okay?

19:18.970 --> 19:21.310
You're worried about the celestial hero?

19:21.710 --> 19:24.940
That too, but... Reiren would be mad.

19:25.420 --> 19:26.850
A strange human.

19:29.230 --> 19:30.280
Run!

19:35.970 --> 19:36.900
Rinne!

19:38.570 --> 19:39.570
Let's go!

19:49.610 --> 19:51.540
Universal Mirroring: Fire!

20:03.220 --> 20:04.790
The forbidden sword!

20:05.350 --> 20:06.710
Jump in!

20:23.880 --> 20:26.490
Universal Mirroring: Thunder!

20:28.950 --> 20:29.950
Disappear!

20:52.050 --> 20:56.300
We're really okay with using 
this much material, right?

20:56.300 --> 20:58.560
We're really counting on you, Reiren-chan!

20:58.860 --> 21:01.870
Human bullets don't work anyway.

21:03.480 --> 21:05.200
But with this...

21:05.890 --> 21:06.950
What the?!

21:09.610 --> 21:11.370
What just happened?

21:20.290 --> 21:22.320
I'm a little tired.

21:22.320 --> 21:23.960
Y-Yeah...

21:25.800 --> 21:27.050
What's wrong?

21:34.770 --> 21:37.740
What is... this magical power?

21:45.890 --> 21:47.070
That thing...

21:47.620 --> 21:49.800
It's the one that had Rinne imprisoned.

21:50.730 --> 21:52.810
Last Riser Aspect 2:

21:53.400 --> 21:58.080
"Will of the World" commencing 
interference with fate.

21:59.320 --> 22:04.960
Commencing deletion of final entity...

22:05.050 --> 22:09.970
<b>Episode 11
"Where Fate Lies"</b>

23:37.140 --> 23:39.980
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?
